  "details": "When talking, \nConsecutive visemes in VRChat are smoothly blended from one shape to another.\n\nWhen using hard shapes for visemes (like 2D mouth cards)\nIt would work much nicer if the viseme system has a mode where it forgoes any blending and provides a hard transition (and only 1 viseme active at any given moment) when talking.\n\nHaving a \"stop-motion viseme mode\" to activate on an avatar would greatly improve the look of avatars using card based mouth shapes.",
